  "description": "Nalix.Shared provides the foundational low-level primitives and shared utilities\nfor the Nalix ecosystem — including configuration binding, memory pooling,\nLZ4 compression, high-performance messaging, and lightweight serialization.\n\nIt is optimized for zero-allocation patterns, Span{T}-based APIs, and unsafe memory access \nto achieve maximum throughput in real-time and networking environments.",
